DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
4026::$$$message_0030_0000_0000$$$::I guess I'll go back to my room. Not like I have anything better to do.[lr]::
4027::$$$message_0030_0000_0001$$$::I could relax in front of the TV in the living room, but I'd be intruding on Saber and Rider.[lr]::
4028::$$$message_0030_0000_0002$$$::They know I don't care about sports or travel programs, so they'd start to feel bad about me being there.::
4029::$$$message_0030_0001_0000$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
4030::$$$message_0030_0001_0001$$$::My bedroom door is open.[lr]::
4031::$$$message_0030_0001_0002$$$::Is someone cleaning it for me?[lr]::
4032::$$$message_0030_0001_0003$$$::I don't have anything to hide in there but...::
4033::$$$message_0030_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
4034::$$$message_0030_0002_0001$$$::I silence my footsteps and creep up to the door.[lr]::
4035::$$$message_0030_0002_0002$$$::Saber and Rider are in the living room, so that leaves...::
4036::$$$message_0030_0003_0000$$$::"...Bingo."[lr]::
4037::$$$message_0030_0003_0001$$$::The person is staring at my desk. I must have left something there.::
4038::$$$message_0030_0004_0000$$$::I could just quietly go back to the living room, but I'm curious what expression Sakura is making.[lr]::
4039::$$$message_0030_0004_0001$$$::"...Sakura?"::
4040::$$$message_0030_0005_0000$$$::Sakura doesn't startle. She just stares back at me.[lr]::
4041::$$$message_0030_0005_0001$$$::...For some reason, it feels awkward, as if I've been caught peeping into Sakura's room.[lr]::
4042::$$$message_0030_0005_0002$$$::"Uh...were you in the middle of something? I'll come back later."[lr]::
4043::$$$message_0030_0005_0003$$$::Even though it's my room, I apologize for intruding and start to retreat.[lr]::
4044::$$$message_0030_0005_0004$$$::She seemed so tense that I felt like backing off was the only thing to do...::
4045::$$$message_0030_0006_0000$$$::"Senpai! [wait canskip=false time=400][clfg][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=-429 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=641 imag=1.3 time=6300 cy=240 mag=1.3 my=0 storage=i士郎部屋 rot=-0.0 accel=0][fg left=900 index=4000 top=39 storage=桜私服08k(近)][fg left=-100 index=3000 top=-425 storage=シネスコw1000a][fg left=-100 index=2000 top=525 storage=シネスコw1000b][fg index=1000 top=131 left=302 storage=桜私服08k(遠)][movefg textoff=0 page=back opacity=255 left=166 top=39 time=200 accel=1 storage=桜私服08k(近)][movefg textoff=0 page=back opacity=255 time=6200 pos=r accel=0 storage=桜私服08k(遠)][transex textoff=0 rule=走る感じ(右から) time=200][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=13 top=39 time=6000 accel=0 storage=桜私服08k(近)][wvl]Is Tohsaka threatening you!?"[lr]::
4046::$$$message_0030_0006_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
4047::$$$message_0030_0006_0002$$$::Okay, isn't this a little too intense?[lr]::
4048::$$$message_0030_0006_0003$$$::...Tohsaka threatening me? What a silly question.::
4049::$$$message_0030_0007_0000$$$::"Yep, she sure is. As usual."[lr]::
4050::$$$message_0030_0007_0001$$$::"Don't lie to me! [cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=桜私服08k(遠) time=300 textoff=0]I-I mean, she even sent you an ultimatum!"[lr]::
4051::$$$message_0030_0007_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
4052::$$$message_0030_0007_0003$$$::You're not listening to me, Miss Matou.[lr]::
4053::$$$message_0030_0007_0004$$$::But an ultimatum...? I think I've seen the stationery Sakura is holding before...[lr]::
4054::$$$message_0030_0007_0005$$$::"Sakura, that's..."::
4055::$$$message_0030_0008_0000$$$::"I'm sorry. I was cleaning your room, when [cacheimage storage=桜私服08b(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服08b(遠) time=300 textoff=0]I stumbled on this. This letter is from my sister, right?"::
4056::$$$message_0030_0009_0000$$$::...Hehehe. It's the perfect threatening letter, even when I reread it after all this time.[lr]::
4057::$$$message_0030_0009_0001$$$::Every time I read it, I can feel the grim reaper breathing down my neck.::
4058::$$$message_0030_0010_0000$$$::"Oh, yeah. It would give you the wrong idea if you just found it.[lr]::
4059::$$$message_0030_0010_0001$$$::...I'm impressed you figured out who wrote it, though."::
4060::$$$message_0030_0011_0000$$$::"Well, this stationery... No, I mean, she's the only one in all of Fuyuki who would write a letter like this!"[lr]::
4061::$$$message_0030_0011_0001$$$::...Ahhh, such dazzling sibling love.[lr]::
4062::$$$message_0030_0011_0002$$$::One yellow card to Sakura Matou.::
4063::$$$message_0030_0012_0000$$$::"She wrote 'I'm not mad,' but she would never write a letter like this unless she was angry!"[lr]::
4064::$$$message_0030_0012_0001$$$::"Nice. You know her well."::
4065::$$$message_0030_0013_0000$$$::"And she said she'd k-kill you![lr]::
4066::$$$message_0030_0013_0001$$$::If that isn't a threat, then what is!?"[lr]::
4067::$$$message_0030_0013_0002$$$::She did cross it out, though.[lr]::
4068::$$$message_0030_0013_0003$$$::I don't think anybody would take this letter at face value.::
4069::$$$message_0030_0014_0000$$$::"I won't stand for this, even if it's her...[cacheimage storage=桜私服11b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服11b(中) textoff=0]I'll protect you, Senpai. This is self-defense, a completely reasonable and proportional use of force, yes..."[lr]::
4070::$$$message_0030_0014_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服14b(中) textoff=0]Sakura mutters to herself.[lr]::
4071::$$$message_0030_0014_0002$$$::I'd better clear up this misunderstanding before things get extremely bad.::
4072::$$$message_0030_0015_0000$$$::"No, it's okay, Sakura. I'm not being threatened by anyone, and Tohsaka didn't mean it when she wrote this letter."[lr]::
4073::$$$message_0030_0015_0001$$$::"You're lying. Please tell the truth, Senpai."[lr]::
4074::$$$message_0030_0015_0002$$$::She answers instantly.[lr]::
4075::$$$message_0030_0015_0003$$$::Second yellow card to Sakura.[lr]::
4076::$$$message_0030_0015_0004$$$::In other words, next card is red.::
4077::$$$message_0030_0016_0000$$$::"No, it's not like that.[lr]::
4078::$$$message_0030_0016_0001$$$::Just take a breath and calm down, Sakura. Tohsaka's always been off-kilter. She goes overboard in everything she does."[lr]::
4079::$$$message_0030_0016_0002$$$::Oh. That seemed to strike a chord with Sakura, because her anger cools.::
4080::$$$message_0030_0017_0000$$$::"Y-you're right."[lr]::
4081::$$$message_0030_0017_0001$$$::"And she actually sent me this a long time ago.[lr]::
4082::$$$message_0030_0017_0002$$$::None of it matters anymore. It just got mixed up with my other junk."::
4083::$$$message_0030_0018_0000$$$::"Huh... But are you really okay?"[lr]::
4084::$$$message_0030_0018_0001$$$::"I did what she said to do in the letter...or so I'd like to think. I never want to get another one."[lr]::
4085::$$$message_0030_0018_0002$$$::I definitely don't want to see some creepy letter written with a ruler, or made up of newspaper clippings, or phrases duplicated twenty times in a word processor.::
4086::$$$message_0030_0019_0000$$$::"...I'm sorry. I lost my temper."[lr]::
4087::$$$message_0030_0019_0001$$$::"It's all right. Anyone would've been surprised."::
4088::$$$message_0030_0020_0000$$$::"But...if this isn't an ultimatum, then it's her, um...[cacheimage storage=桜私服02g(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][fadebgm time=200 volume=0][chgfg storage=桜私服02g(中) time=300 textoff=0]love letter, right!?"::
4089::$$$message_0030_0021_0000$$$::   I'm speechless.[lr]::
4090::$$$message_0030_0021_0001$$$::From ultimatum to love letter? That isn't just 180 degrees, it's so far off base that it's a full 540 degrees in the opposite direction.[lr]::
4091::$$$message_0030_0021_0002$$$::Why would Sakura think that?::
4092::$$$message_0030_0022_0000$$$::"Sakura, I think you're making some pretty dramatic leaps of logic."[lr]::
4093::$$$message_0030_0022_0001$$$::"B-but if she isn't mad at you and wants to see you in private...[cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg storage=桜私服08k(中) time=300 textoff=0] That's literally the most stereotypical love letter there is!"[lr]::
4094::$$$message_0030_0022_0002$$$::"No it isn't! What kind of love letter threatens to kill the recipient if he doesn't show up!?"[lr]::
4095::$$$message_0030_0022_0003$$$::None of them do!::
4096::$$$message_0030_0023_0000$$$::"But [font italic=true]she'd[font italic=false] write one like that!"[lr]::
4097::$$$message_0030_0023_0001$$$::Such ironclad bonds of sisterhood![lr]::
4098::$$$message_0030_0023_0002$$$::They know each other all too well!::
4099::$$$message_0030_0024_0000$$$::"You kept the letter, too... I can't see it as anything but a love letter.[lr]::
4100::$$$message_0030_0024_0001$$$::...That must be nice. Maybe I should've written you a love letter."[lr]::
4101::$$$message_0030_0024_0002$$$::"Huh?"::
4102::$$$message_0030_0025_0000$$$::The strangely tense atmosphere suddenly turns cozy.[lr]::
4103::$$$message_0030_0025_0001$$$::"Uh... Well, I'd be happy to receive as many as you'll write me."[lr]::
4104::$$$message_0030_0025_0002$$$::...Maybe it's the atmosphere that made me say something so out of character for me.[lr]::
4105::$$$message_0030_0025_0003$$$::The conversation suddenly dies off, and we're both left blushing at each other.::
4106::$$$message_0030_0026_0000$$$::"Re...[cacheimage storage=桜私服10d頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10d頬(中) textoff=0]really?"[lr]::
4107::$$$message_0030_0026_0001$$$::"Uh... Well, if you want to make it a deal, then I'd appreciate it if you gave me one."::
4108::$$$message_0030_0027_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服13a頬(中) textoff=0][line len=3]More silence.[lr]::
4109::$$$message_0030_0027_0001$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服13b頬(中) textoff=0]It's hard to look her in the eye, and we're both becoming extremely self-conscious in this room...[lr]::
4110::$$$message_0030_0027_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10e頬(中) textoff=0]Right, I should just change the subject!::
4111::$$$message_0030_0028_0000$$$::"S-so you were cleaning my room, Sakura?"[lr]::
4112::$$$message_0030_0028_0001$$$::"...Yes! I should keep going!"[lr]::
4113::$$$message_0030_0028_0002$$$::"Right, let me help."[lr]::
4114::$$$message_0030_0028_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服09a(中) textoff=0]I'm so confused that the order of events is getting mixed up in my head. Oh, well.[wait canskip=false time=300][clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から storage=桜私服09a(中) textoff=0]::
4115::$$$message_0030_0029_0000$$$::We spend a little under five minutes tidying up the room.[lr]::
4116::$$$message_0030_0029_0001$$$::"Did you find something, Senpai?"[lr]::
4117::$$$message_0030_0029_0002$$$::"Ah... It's just a ticket. To a movie, I think."[lr]::
4118::$$$message_0030_0029_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服01a(中) textoff=0]If it's here, the movie must no longer be playing.[lr]::
4119::$$$message_0030_0029_0004$$$::Wait, no. It's a ticket for admission.::
4120::$$$message_0030_0030_0000$$$::"...A ticket for free admission to Waku Waku Zabuun?"[lr]::
4121::$$$message_0030_0030_0001$$$::"That's the pool in Shinto. Fuji-nee must've picked up one of these."[lr]::
4122::$$$message_0030_0030_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0]Which I appreciate, but I wish she wouldn't randomly leave it here.[lr]::
4123::$$$message_0030_0030_0003$$$::We could've used it during the summer. What a waste.::
4124::$$$message_0030_0031_0000$$$::"You know, it's actually a water park that's open year round, regardless of the weather."[lr]::
4125::$$$message_0030_0031_0001$$$::"Oh yeah, now that you mention it."[lr]::
4126::$$$message_0030_0031_0002$$$::I think it marketed itself as an endless summer concept that guests can enjoy even in the fall or winter.[lr]::
4127::$$$message_0030_0031_0003$$$::Then...we could even go to the pool right now.::
4128::$$$message_0030_0032_0000$$$::"...It hasn't expired yet. We didn't go to the beach this summer, either... Sakura, do you have a swimsuit handy?"[lr]::
4129::$$$message_0030_0032_0001$$$::"Oh, yes. It just so happens I bought a new one, actually..."[lr]::
4130::$$$message_0030_0032_0002$$$::Right, I heard she went shopping with Saber.[lr]::
4131::$$$message_0030_0032_0003$$$::I haven't seen Sakura in a swimsuit before, so why don't I...::
4132::$$$message_0030_0033_0000$$$::"Sakura, want to go here next time? We've got a free ticket."[lr]::
4133::$$$message_0030_0033_0001$$$::"Huh? D-[cacheimage storage=桜私服05f(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服05f(中) time=300 textoff=0]do you really mean that!?"[lr]::
4134::$$$message_0030_0033_0002$$$::"If there's time on a day off. I feel like we were meant to find this ticket."::
4135::$$$message_0030_0034_0000$$$::"Yes, I'd be happy to go with you!"[lr]::
4136::$$$message_0030_0034_0001$$$::"Okay, sounds like a plan.[lr]::
4137::$$$message_0030_0034_0002$$$::...Oh, maybe I should've invited you with a love letter."::
4138::$$$message_0030_0035_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10d頬(中) textoff=0][say storage=emi0315_sak_0230 name=桜]But I'm happier to hear it from you in person!"[lr]::
4139::$$$message_0030_0035_0001$$$::"Yeah, ok."[lr]::
4140::$$$message_0030_0035_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服03d頬(中) textoff=0]Plans made... The thought of Sakura's swimsuit sends a rush of excitement and nervousness through me.::
4141::$$$message_0030_0036_0000$$$::"Senpai...should we keep cleaning your room?"[lr]::
4142::$$$message_0030_0036_0001$$$::"Oh, right."::
904066::$$$message_9030_0013_0001$$$::"If that isn't a threat, then what is!?"::

